id: god-of-power
name: God of Power
optionOf: divine-magic
# "You gain the Muscular Warrior Talent" - given with it when it is written.
grantsTalent: muscular-warrior
description: The Muscular Warrior Talent, and Force Modifier 1(T) higher in a Form or an Enhancement.
text: >
  God of Power [Passive]: You gain the Muscular Warrior Talent. Additionally, increase your Force Modifier by 1(T) while
  in a Form or an Enhancement.

---

# "Increase your Force Modifier by 1(T) while in a Form or an Enhancement" - Forms and Enhancements are not built yet, so
# nothing can tell whether you are in one: the table adds it while you are.
